  "title": "021-不买新衣服只穿“旧衣服”会快乐吗？中古服装太有门道了",
  "source_url": "https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683dc09e38dcc57c64308370",
  "source_kind": "public-page",
  "fetched_at": "2026-07-30T01:57:56.323451+00:00",
  "shownotes_html": "<p><span>我时常觉得我们很多苦恼来自于</span><strong><span>消费主义</span></strong><span>给我们植入了太多似是而非的观念，创造出许多并</span><strong><span>不必要的欲望</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>“最新潮”“限定款”“高奢感”“老钱风”</span></strong><span>……各种广告语、slogan一遍又一遍地给你洗脑</span><strong><span>“你消费的东西定义了你是谁”</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不过，我的朋友木木的生活方式给了我很大的启发——购买、收藏并穿着中古服装。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目我和木木、南南一起聊了聊服装与生活、审美、个性之间的关系，还有南南和设计师朋友改造衣服的快乐、以及“穿外婆留下的衣服是种什么体验”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也被衣柜塞满却总觉得没衣服穿困扰，或者想用中古服装对抗消费主义焦虑，这期绝对值得听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><span>木木 南南</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>羊行</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>录制日期：</span></strong><span>2025年5月13日</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>发布日期：</span></strong><span>2025年6月3日</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主要内容</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"0\">00:00</a> 中古服装与生活乐趣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"112\">01:52</a> 服装如何为生活带来乐趣与满足感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"276\">04:36</a> 家庭教育对个人审美和价值观的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"465\">07:45</a> 通过中古品搭配时尚：买手的角色与职责</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"556\">09:16</a> 买手与金融行业职业路径探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"658\">10:58</a> 金融行业与中古服装的碰撞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/luNcB9NZiPJPnpKF5jigSveaOzIq.jpg\"></figure><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvcb4HEyNo2WEFXuxouyjP7Y_qIC.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>节目中第一件提到的裤子（供图：木木）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"838\">13:58</a> 探讨衣物耐久性与品质的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"962\">16:02</a> 中古服饰在电视剧《繁花》中的应用与解读</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrE68x8tYe6Y6U4Q_28cwNLXFNRv.jpg\"></figure><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/llcAp49Kn1-RtOSYmu4xnLJ2qHV1.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>节目中第二件提到的《繁花》同款圣罗兰连衣裙（供图：木木）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1125\">18:45</a> 从复古服装到现代时尚的探讨</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmZVGLTbR12ClCQaoWdTVEOX5rE4.jpg\"></figure><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsvZ2lwnb6krf76snzLcXiZCcjn4.jpg\"></figure><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/ls7SswtVfItrdSICAv93E1zxrFdR.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>节目中第三件提到的经典小礼裙（供图：木木）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1313\">21:53</a> 探讨西装设计理念及经典品牌高缇耶</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/luDla_frZvnixqQ-YWSf0dVtICKY.jpg\"></figure><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpeimXbcNG2FCGiWgWfqE6KMCBUA.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>节目中第四件提到的高缇耶西服（供图：木木）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1501\">25:01</a> 探讨高端服饰的设计与购买体验</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgV2aFzwf5WYBB7AtNj8mfrjkVKN.jpg\"></figure><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmttE-vkroa5lRgo61xG43kRRQzi.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>节目中第五件提到华伦天奴上衣（供图：木木）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1840\">30:40</a> 衣柜、穿搭与自我认知的探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2209\">36:49</a> 通过穿衣寻找自我与实用美学的平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2544\">42:24</a> 服装消费与个人表达：从品牌故事到个性化需求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2902\">48:22</a> 从清华艺博服饰展到巴黎军事博物馆的服装演变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3277\">54:37</a> 中古服装与可持续消费趋势的探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>配乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Nat King Cole - Quizas Quizas Quizas</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nat King Cole - Two Loves Have I</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>后期：</span></strong><span>米铺工作室</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>订阅《苦中找乐》：</span></strong><span>你能想到的平台都可以找到并订阅。</span></p>",
